{"meta":{"templateCredsSetupCompleted":false},"name":"Remove backgrounds and upscale product photos in bulk from Google Sheets","nodes":[{"id":"692a153e-b063-4554-aa47-3eb3ea67622a","name":"Overview","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-420,60],"parameters":{"width":460,"height":660,"content":"## Remove backgrounds and upscale product photos in bulk\n\n**Who's it for:** e-commerce teams and freelancers who receive product photos with busy backgrounds or low resolution and need clean, large images for a shop or a marketplace.\n\n**How it works**\n1. Reads image URLs from a Google Sheet.\n2. Sends them in one batch to the **Background Remover API** actor on Apify, which returns a transparent PNG per image.\n3. Sends the cutouts to the **Image Upscaler API** actor, which upscales each one 2x (change `scale` to `4` in the node).\n4. Writes the final image URL, width and height back to the sheet, next to the original. Failed images are marked with the reason and are not charged.\n\n**How to set up**\n- Create a sheet with the columns `image_url`, `result_url`, `width`, `height`, `status`, `error` and fill `image_url`.\n- Connect Google Sheets in the first and last nodes and pick your sheet.\n- Add your Apify API token as an Apify credential in both Apify nodes (install the verified Apify node if needed).\n\n**Requirements:** an Apify account (pay per image, no subscription to the actors) and a Google account.\n\n**Customize:** replace Google Sheets with Airtable, Google Drive or a webhook; remove the upscaling step if you only need cutouts. Each Apify node has a maximum cost per run of $5 that you can raise."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"06704cbe-c9ed-4132-a00a-ccdc3dbf9c2a","name":"Sheet columns","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[80,480],"parameters":{"color":5,"width":360,"height":140,"content":"### Sheet columns\n`image_url` (input), then `result_url`, `width`, `height`, `status`, `error` (filled by the workflow)."},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"50f572db-335b-4901-9f27-3df50e780c06","name":"Start","type":"n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger","position":[100,300],"parameters":{},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"0dbb61f5-47d9-45a9-9cb5-d44a89b7164a","name":"Read image URLs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[300,300],"parameters":{"options":{},"operation":"read","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"","cachedResultName":""},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"","cachedResultName":""}},"typeVersion":4.7},{"id":"033b210a-117a-4338-b807-49c627c26fc8","name":"Collect image URLs","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[500,300],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// One Apify call for the whole sheet. The actor removes duplicate URLs,\n// so each row remembers the position of its URL in the de-duplicated list.\nconst unique = [];\nconst rows = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const url = String(item.json.image_url || '').trim();\n  if (!url) continue;\n  if (!unique.includes(url)) unique.push(url);\n  rows.push({ row_number: item.json.row_number, idx: unique.indexOf(url) });\n}\nif (!rows.length) return [];   // empty sheet: stop here, no paid run\nreturn [{ json: { rows, imageUrls: unique } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"70a8eadc-62c9-4fc7-8949-d7f77e0f02d9","name":"Remove backgrounds","type":"@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify","position":[700,300],"parameters":{"memory":1024,"actorId":"sherwood~background-remover-batch","resource":"Actors","operation":"Run actor and get dataset","customBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ imageUrls: $json.imageUrls, mode: 'general', outputFormat: 'png' }) }}","maxTotalChargeUsd":5},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"de0a2570-063b-4dd2-a691-57f4a9367473","name":"Prepare upscaling","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[900,300],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Results arrive in finishing order: sort by index (= position in imageUrls),\n// then give each sheet row the result of its URL.\nconst { rows } = $('Collect image URLs').first().json;\nconst cutouts = $input.all().map(i => i.json).sort((a, b) => a.index - b.index);\nconst ok = [], failed = [];\nfor (const c of cutouts) {\n  const targets = rows.filter(r => r.idx === c.index).map(r => r.row_number);\n  if (!targets.length) continue;\n  if (c.status === 'ok') ok.push({ row_numbers: targets, cutoutUrl: c.outputUrl });\n  else for (const row_number of targets) failed.push({ row_number, error: c.error || 'background removal failed' });\n}\nreturn [{ json: { ok, failed, cutoutUrls: ok.map(o => o.cutoutUrl) } }];"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"e25e1ccd-dff6-48de-ad3b-069feb0a44ef","name":"Any cutouts?","type":"n8n-nodes-base.if","position":[1100,300],"parameters":{"options":{},"conditions":{"options":{"version":2,"leftValue":"","caseSensitive":true,"typeValidation":"strict"},"combinator":"and","conditions":[{"id":"885ff16f-80d4-4841-8204-d7f85485356e","operator":{"type":"number","operation":"gt"},"leftValue":"={{ $json.cutoutUrls.length }}","rightValue":0}]}},"typeVersion":2.2},{"id":"73c9aa39-3528-480b-9fc9-b6b812a0ac05","name":"Upscale cutouts","type":"@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify","position":[1300,220],"parameters":{"memory":1024,"actorId":"sherwood~image-upscaler-batch","resource":"Actors","operation":"Run actor and get dataset","customBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ imageUrls: $json.cutoutUrls, scale: '2', outputFormat: 'png' }) }}","maxTotalChargeUsd":5},"typeVersion":1},{"id":"ddf36b88-0486-4714-b77a-98d767d053d7","name":"Match results to rows","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","position":[1500,300],"parameters":{"jsCode":"// Map each upscaled image back to its sheet rows (index = position in the cutout list).\nconst prep = $('Prepare upscaling').first().json;\nconst upscaled = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(j => j.inputUrl !== undefined).sort((a, b) => a.index - b.index);\nconst out = [];\nfor (const u of upscaled) {\n  const entry = prep.ok[u.index];\n  if (!entry) continue;\n  for (const row_number of entry.row_numbers) {\n    out.push(u.status === 'ok'\n      ? { row_number, result_url: u.outputUrl, width: u.width, height: u.height, status: 'ok', error: '' }\n      : { row_number, result_url: '', width: '', height: '', status: 'error', error: u.error || 'upscale failed' });\n  }\n}\nfor (const f of prep.failed) out.push({ row_number: f.row_number, result_url: '', width: '', height: '', status: 'error', error: f.error });\nreturn out.map(json => ({ json }));"},"typeVersion":2},{"id":"dda48513-e427-4b6d-aac1-a6485133b79d","name":"Write results","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets","position":[1700,300],"parameters":{"columns":{"value":{},"schema":[{"id":"result_url","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"result_url","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"width","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"width","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"height","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"height","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"status","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"status","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"error","type":"string","display":true,"required":false,"displayName":"error","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true},{"id":"row_number","type":"number","display":true,"readOnly":true,"required":false,"displayName":"row_number","defaultMatch":false,"canBeUsedToMatch":true}],"mappingMode":"autoMapInputData","matchingColumns":["row_number"],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false},"options":{},"operation":"update","sheetName":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"","cachedResultName":""},"documentId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"","cachedResultName":""}},"typeVersion":4.7}],"pinData":{},"settings":{"executionOrder":"v1"},"connections":{"Start":{"main":[[{"node":"Read image URLs","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Any cutouts?":{"main":[[{"node":"Upscale cutouts","type":"main","index":0}],[{"node":"Match results to rows","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Read image URLs":{"main":[[{"node":"Collect image URLs","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Upscale cutouts":{"main":[[{"node":"Match results to rows","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Prepare upscaling":{"main":[[{"node":"Any cutouts?","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Collect image URLs":{"main":[[{"node":"Remove backgrounds","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Remove backgrounds":{"main":[[{"node":"Prepare upscaling","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Match results to rows":{"main":[[{"node":"Write results","type":"main","index":0}]]}}}